Package: globalmacrodata
Title: Global Macro Database R Package
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R:
    c(person("Riccardo", "Dal Cero", email = "dalcero@safe-frankfurt.de", role = "cre"),
      person("Mohamed", "Lehbib", email = "lehbib@u.nus.edu", role = "aut"),
      person("Karsten", "Müller", email = "kmueller@nus.edu.sg", role = "aut"))
Description: Download and access the Global Macro Database (GMD): 79 macroeconomic variables across 243 countries, 1086-2030. Fetch cleaned data from 121+ sources (IMF, World Bank, OECD, etc.), with version control, filtering by country/variables/year, raw source-level data, and citations. No dependencies beyond standard packages.
